eHeaderCtaUrl":38,"secondaryCtaText":43,"secondaryCtaLabel":43,"secondaryCtaUrl":44,"PageHeaderImage":46,"heroImage":57,"videoContent":58,"showPremiumLogo":21},"standard","Send car parts with an Evri courier",[32],{"type":33,"text":34,"spans":35,"direction":36},"paragraph","Send car parts quickly and securely for as little as £2.62",[],"ltr","Get a quote",{"link_type":39,"key":40,"url":41,"target":42},"Web","264a2d3b-91c1-491e-872b-3ea9c749530c","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend","",null,{"link_type":45},"Any",{"dimensions":47,"alt":50,"copyright":43,"url":51,"id":52,"edit":53},{"width":48,"height":49},300,79,"Send","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002Fa7f4a191-2576-452d-be4a-2028421cf6a4_send.svg","YhYpMRIAAC8A0QCC",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":19},"page_header$9237af6a-b6a9-4c95-a812-334bc03f2cb2","page_header",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":62,"primary":64,"id":94,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":43},[63],{},{"CardImage":65,"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":74,"CardText":75,"ButtonText":91,"ButtonUrl":92,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":66,"alt":69,"copyright":43,"url":70,"id":71,"edit":72},{"width":67,"height":68},1000,667,"A customer is standing in their doorway holding a large parcel and looking down at it with a smile.","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ7WyZJ7c43Q3f9d8_Customerholdingboxondoorstep.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=1%2C0%2C5220%2C3482&w=1000&h=667","Z7WyZJ7c43Q3f9d8",{"x":55,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},"none","Ship car parts for low costs with a reliable courier",[76,88],{"type":33,"text":77,"spans":78,"direction":36},"Whether you’re looking to offload a spare tyre or selling a variety of car parts in large quantities, by choosing Evri as your courier you can enjoy cheap and secure delivery both domestically and internationally. With our bulk shipping integration, you can kick start your business selling car parts with convenient features to streamline your experience sending multiple parcels.  ",[79,86],{"start":80,"end":81,"type":82,"data":83},223,248,"hyperlink",{"link_type":39,"url":84,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fbulk-send","_self",{"start":80,"end":81,"type":87},"strong",{"type":33,"text":89,"spans":90,"direction":36},"Find out how to package car parts for delivery, information on our pricing, the drop-off and collection options available to you, and items you can and cannot send through Evri.",[],"Get a courier quote",{"link_type":39,"key":93,"url":41,"target":42},"3ee60c47-cf00-4881-96fb-e0844b60145e","card$bba4824a-b0d7-419b-9c3a-2fcdc9f7e789","card",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":97,"primary":99,"id":132,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":43},[98],{},{"CardImage":100,"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":109,"CardText":110,"ButtonText":129,"ButtonUrl":130,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":101,"alt":102,"copyright":43,"url":103,"id":104,"edit":105},{"width":67,"height":68},"A handful of parcels are being handed to a recipient at the door. Both the courier and recipient are clearly visible","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6y-fZbqstJ9-iKb_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9263.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=196%2C135%2C7123%2C4751&w=1000&h=667","Z6y-fZbqstJ9-iKb",{"x":106,"y":107,"zoom":108,"background":56},196,135,1.15,"Send car tyres from £5.87",[111,120],{"type":33,"text":112,"spans":113,"direction":36},"The vast majority of tyres and alloy wheels fit comfortably within Evri’s size and weight limits, provided they are packaged properly according to our guidance. Shipping tyres and alloy wheels couldn’t be easier with Evri, and we offer some of the lowest prices on the market. ",[114,119],{"start":115,"end":116,"type":82,"data":117},74,96,{"link_type":39,"url":118,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fparcel-size-and-weight-guide",{"start":115,"end":116,"type":87},{"type":33,"text":121,"spans":122,"direction":36},"Time may be of the essence to your customers, as they could be waiting on the parcel to get their vehicle up and running again. Thankfully our network offers Standard Delivery with an average of 2-4 days, or upgrade to Next Day Delivery for those urgent car issues. You can also take advantage of even better pricing when you spend more than £30. ",[123,128],{"start":124,"end":125,"type":82,"data":126},326,345,{"link_type":39,"url":127,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fswitch-to-evri",{"start":124,"end":125,"type":87},"Send a car tyres with a courier",{"link_type":39,"key":131,"url":41},"ef87d1fc-5da9-4721-875b-97c971fc3cbb","card$fe82d85a-8688-42bf-9cb1-f466f6b76f86",{"variation":134,"version":26,"items":135,"primary":191,"id":194,"slice_type":195,"slice_label":43},"listComponent",[136,149,167,179],{"title":137,"content":138,"icon":142},"Wrap your parcel safely and securely",[139],{"type":33,"text":140,"spans":141,"direction":36},"To ensure that your parcel reaches its destination safely, make sure that the item is completely wrapped, and any empty space in the box is filled with bubble wrap or newspaper.",[],{"dimensions":143,"alt":145,"copyright":43,"url":146,"id":147,"edit":148},{"width":144,"height":144},40,"Vehicle parts icon","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F60c6b591-52a0-4ad9-9c4c-d975eaa3d443_vehicle+parts.svg","Yh96FRIAACwA-Zrn",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},{"title":150,"content":151,"icon":161},"Find an appropriate box for your item",[152],{"type":33,"text":153,"spans":154,"direction":36},"Place the item inside a sturdy box, ideally recycled, read more on sustainable packaging here. For larger items, the box shouldn’t be much larger than the item itself, as we want to make sure that it fits within Evri’s size limit. ",[155,160],{"start":156,"end":157,"type":82,"data":158},67,88,{"link_type":39,"url":159,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Feverything-you-need-to-know-about-sustainable-packaging",{"start":156,"end":157,"type":87},{"dimensions":162,"alt":163,"copyright":43,"url":164,"id":165,"edit":166},{"width":144,"height":144},"Parcel icon","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F15159101-ea95-4f4d-8762-549a8e631c4f_parcel3.svg","Yh96GBIAACwA-Zsn",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},{"title":168,"content":169,"icon":173},"Place contact information within the parcel for assurance",[170],{"type":33,"text":171,"spans":172,"direction":36},"In the event that the address label on the outside of the box is lost or damaged, place a piece of paper with your name, address and phone number, as well as the name and address of the parcels destination so we can complete the parcels journey under any circumstances.",[],{"dimensions":174,"alt":175,"copyright":43,"url":176,"id":177,"edit":178},{"width":144,"height":144},"Followed instructions icon","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F0b60c675-436d-4ca1-8857-2bfbff3cb847_followed_instructions.svg","YflB_BEAACIA8pcK",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},{"title":180,"content":181,"icon":185},"Fasten the box thoroughly",[182],{"type":33,"text":183,"spans":184,"direction":36},"Finally, fasten the box with an adequate amount of tape, making sure that no openings are left uncovered, and the tape runs around all of the cardboard flaps and edges. For added security, choose a more durable tape when packaging your car parts.",[],{"dimensions":186,"alt":187,"copyright":43,"url":188,"id":189,"edit":190},{"width":144,"height":144},"Icon of a parcel","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F8321288c-05db-46b8-9767-db5da18fbfae_parcel1.svg","Yh96FhIAAC4A-Zr2",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},{"theme":29,"title":192,"description":193},"How to package car parts for shipping","Our parcels go through many stages of transit, and with car parts being quite fragile, we’ll need your help to make sure that we can deliver your package in the same condition that you left it in. Tyres are far more robust in nature; designed to carry vehicles over rough terrain, it’s unlikely that a conveyor belt or the back of a van will result in any damage, however there are still factors that need to be considered for the ease of the courier.","list_block$19fd3637-bb40-4828-a24b-fda17be19db1","list_block",{"variation":197,"version":26,"items":198,"primary":200,"id":225,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":43},"cardNoImageWithCta",[199],{},{"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":201,"CardText":202,"ButtonText":43,"ButtonUrl":224,"IsEco":21},"What car parts can’t you send with Evri",[203,206,209,212,215],{"type":33,"text":204,"spans":205,"direction":36},"Unfortunately, some car parts do fall under Evri restrictions when it comes to prohibited items and non-compensation items. These are as follows:",[],{"type":33,"text":207,"spans":208,"direction":36},"Vehicle parts containing liquids, such as car batteries, along with items weighing over 15kg or exceeding our maximum dimension limits, are prohibited from transit with Evri couriers. ",[],{"type":33,"text":210,"spans":211,"direction":36},"Liquids under 1000ml are allowed for transport, but oil is prohibited. This includes engine oil, transmission fluid, and many types of brake fluid, which are not permitted for transit with Evri couriers.",[],{"type":33,"text":213,"spans":214,"direction":36},"Vehicle lights and lightbulbs are unable to be covered by our compensation, but can still be sent with a courier.  ",[],{"type":33,"text":216,"spans":217,"direction":36},"Find out what you can and can't send here. ",[218,223],{"start":219,"end":220,"type":82,"data":221},9,36,{"link_type":39,"url":222,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fsend\u002Fwhat-i-can-and-cannot-send",{"start":219,"end":220,"type":87},{"link_type":45},"card$f8a8cb0c-8c31-4aad-bb58-20c8e49f9b97",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":227,"primary":229,"id":245,"slice_type":95,"slice_label":43},[228],{},{"CardImage":230,"CardAvatar":73,"CardTitle":237,"CardText":238,"ButtonText":242,"ButtonUrl":243,"IsEco":21},{"dimensions":231,"alt":233,"copyright":43,"url":234,"id":235,"edit":236},{"width":67,"height":232},643,"A close-up bird's eye view of a customer holding their mobile phone shows the Evri website home page on display. Lots of parcel boxes can be seen in the background.","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZyIqu68jQArT0BYb_small_business.jpg?auto=format,compress","ZyIqu68jQArT0BYb",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},"Extended coverage with Evri",[239],{"type":33,"text":240,"spans":241,"direction":36},"When shipping with Evri, you’re instantly eligible for £20 compensation on your parcel completely FREE. This will cover your windscreen wipers, brake pads, fuel caps and much more. If you’re sending a more high-ticket item like a clutch kit or radiator, don’t fear, we offer extended coverage for compensation up to £999, so you can send your car parts worry free.",[],"Send car parts",{"link_type":39,"key":244,"url":41},"1bcb4d03-52e7-4b5a-9b1a-287a5e3b7539","card$e651599b-2400-4322-968a-405a975e9966",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":247,"primary":288,"id":327,"slice_type":328,"slice_label":43},[248,253,258,263,268,273,278,283],{"column_1_cell":249,"column_2_cell":250,"column_3_cell":251,"column_4_cell":252},"Postable","£2.70","£3.49","+£0.79",{"column_1_cell":254,"column_2_cell":255,"column_3_cell":256,"column_4_cell":257},"0-1kg Small","£3.04","£3.90","+£0.86",{"column_1_cell":259,"column_2_cell":260,"column_3_cell":261,"column_4_cell":262},"0-1kg Standard","£3.29","£4.12","+£0.83",{"column_1_cell":264,"column_2_cell":265,"column_3_cell":266,"column_4_cell":267},"1-2kg Small","£3.52","£4.60","+£1.08",{"column_1_cell":269,"column_2_cell":270,"column_3_cell":271,"column_4_cell":272},"1-2kg Standard","£4.79","£5.48","+£0.69",{"column_1_cell":274,"column_2_cell":275,"column_3_cell":276,"column_4_cell":277},"2-5kg","£6.59","£7.55","+£0.96",{"column_1_cell":279,"column_2_cell":280,"column_3_cell":281,"column_4_cell":282},"5-10kg","£6.68","£7.72","+£1.04",{"column_1_cell":284,"column_2_cell":285,"column_3_cell":286,"column_4_cell":287},"10-15kg","£10.28","£12.35","+£2.07",{"PricingTableImage":289,"PricingTableHeader":295,"PricingTableText":296,"PricingTableButtonText":318,"PricingTableButtonUrl":319,"scrollDown":21,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonText":43,"PricingTablePrimaryButtonUrl":321,"buttonGtmTrack":43,"PricingTableDescription":43,"table_header_row_blue":21,"table_rightmost_column_blue":322,"column_name_1":323,"column_name_2":324,"column_name_3":325,"column_name_4":326},{"dimensions":290,"alt":43,"copyright":43,"url":292,"id":293,"edit":294},{"width":157,"height":291},24,"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F2a1dcc38-ecf2-4a6a-b68d-b28f33e8fe47_send+%281%29.svg","ZcyF-hIAACgAGOcv",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},"Get the best prices on car parts delivery with Evri",[297],{"type":33,"text":298,"spans":299,"direction":36},"Sending car parts across the country Is cheaper than you might think.   We want to save you money, so our standard prices include end-to-end tracked delivery, which when you compare with Royal Mail equates to a fantastic deal. Additionally, we offer upgrade options such as Next Day Delivery and door-to-door courier collection for your convenience. ",[300,305,306,311,312,317],{"start":301,"end":302,"type":82,"data":303},174,197,{"link_type":39,"url":304,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fguides\u002Fevri-vs-royal-mail",{"start":301,"end":302,"type":87},{"start":307,"end":308,"type":82,"data":309},274,291,{"link_type":39,"url":310,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fnext-day-parcel-delivery",{"start":307,"end":308,"type":87},{"start":313,"end":314,"type":82,"data":315},309,327,{"link_type":39,"url":316,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Fcourier-service",{"start":313,"end":314,"type":87},"Send car parts today",{"link_type":39,"key":320,"url":41,"target":42},"4e9a0091-39ce-4fbf-94c0-dc4c71683b4c",{"link_type":45},true,"Weight","Standard","Next Day","Upgrade from","pricing_table_v2$8a5019b9-658d-4130-9418-2c0ad0d8cd24","pricing_table_v2",{"variation":330,"version":26,"items":331,"primary":393,"id":404,"slice_type":405,"slice_label":43},"3Column",[332,354,374],{"Title":333,"Description":338,"Image":342,"Label":43,"UrlText":349,"Url":350,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":353,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[334],{"type":335,"text":336,"spans":337},"heading3","ParcelShops",[],[339],{"type":33,"text":340,"spans":341,"direction":36},"Book your delivery online or in selected Post Offices and drop off your package at one of our 9,000+ ParcelShops. Don’t have a way to print at home? Just get your postage label using our Print in ParcelShop device for free. We’ll take care of everything from there.",[],{"dimensions":343,"alt":344,"copyright":43,"url":345,"id":346,"edit":347},{"width":67,"height":68},"An Evri ParcelShop is in full view with its blue signage and a customer is walking up the accesssbility ramp and holding a parcel.","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf__EVRI_LOCATION_03_3111.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=470%2C0%2C5460%2C3642&w=1000&h=667","Z6TJWZbqstJ9-Tf_",{"x":348,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},470,"Find your local ParcelShop",{"link_type":39,"key":351,"url":352},"7df708f4-988d-446c-926c-b3193d3a0e7b","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops",{"link_type":45},{"Title":355,"Description":359,"Image":363,"Label":43,"UrlText":369,"Url":370,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":373,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[356],{"type":335,"text":357,"spans":358},"Lockers",[],[360],{"type":33,"text":361,"spans":362,"direction":36},"We have 24\u002F7 Lockers available across the UK. Head to your nearest Locker, scan your barcode and place into a secure Locker, ready for collection.",[],{"dimensions":364,"alt":365,"copyright":43,"url":366,"id":367,"edit":368},{"width":67,"height":68},"Customer holding parcel and standing outside at an Evri Locker, watching as their label prints out","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb_EVRI_LOCATION_03_3033.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C9%2C8164%2C5445&w=1000&h=667","Z6THdZbqstJ9-Tdb",{"x":54,"y":219,"zoom":55,"background":56},"Find your nearest parcel locker",{"link_type":39,"key":371,"url":372},"c7be3c98-a36a-461f-9aee-285a9cab4560","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Fparcelshops\u002Flockers",{"link_type":45},{"Title":375,"Description":379,"Image":383,"Label":43,"UrlText":389,"Url":390,"buttonDataGtmTrack":43,"SecondaryButtonText":43,"SecondaryButtonUrl":392,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":43,"ShowAppDownloadCta":21},[376],{"type":335,"text":377,"spans":378},"Courier collection",[],[380],{"type":33,"text":381,"spans":382,"direction":36},"Even for international delivery we offer door to door courier service, so you don’t even need to leave your home or office to run your car parts business. Simply follow the link below to book a collection, and we’ll give you a one-hour window to pick up the parcel.",[],{"dimensions":384,"alt":385,"copyright":43,"url":386,"id":387,"edit":388},{"width":67,"height":68},"An Evri courier is delivering three parcels to a man at his doorstep. He looks pleased to be recieving them","send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zdGZbqstJ9-inj_EVRI_LOCATION_05_8036.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&w=1000&h=667","Z6zdGZbqstJ9-inj",{"x":54,"y":54,"zoom":55,"background":56},"Schedule a courier collection",{"link_type":39,"key":391,"url":316},"1c48ff75-d0e8-4a63-a118-abd232d6dfab",{"link_type":45},{"SectionTitle":394,"SectionDescription":399,"theme":403},[395],{"type":396,"text":397,"spans":398,"direction":36},"heading2","Three easy ways to send a parcel",[],[400],{"type":33,"text":401,"spans":402,"direction":36},"Choose from three cheap and simple ways to send your car parts with a courier:",[],"neutral","article_link_module$8c909b79-e19e-4a7d-8e65-e4daad61827d","article_link_module",{"variation":25,"version":26,"items":407,"primary":458,"id":460,"slice_type":461,"slice_label":43},[408,420,432],{"questionTitle":409,"questionBody":410},"Can I send car parts internationally?",[411],{"type":33,"text":412,"spans":413,"direction":36},"Yes you can! Our international service runs all across the world from the United States, through Europe, Asia and all the way down to Australia. You can find more information on the international hub.",[414,419],{"start":415,"end":416,"type":82,"data":417},182,199,{"link_type":39,"url":418,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Four-services\u002Finternational-courier-services",{"start":415,"end":416,"type":87},{"questionTitle":421,"questionBody":422},"How will I know when my parcel has been delivered?",[423],{"type":33,"text":424,"spans":425,"direction":36},"You can track your parcel through its entire journey, right up until the point of delivery with our parcel tracking service. This means you can see where your parcel is at each stage of the delivery process. We explain each stage of the process on our tracking page to make this easy to follow.",[426,431],{"start":427,"end":428,"type":82,"data":429},100,123,{"link_type":39,"url":430,"target":85},"send-car-parts.html\u002F\u002Fwww.evri.com\u002Ftrack-a-parcel",{"start":427,"end":428,"type":87},{"questionTitle":433,"questionBody":434},"What are the maximum weight and size limits for a parcel?",[435,438,442,445,448,451],{"type":33,"text":436,"spans":437,"direction":36},"To be sure that your parcel is good to send with an Evri courier, please use the following guidelines for size and weight:",[],{"type":439,"text":440,"spans":441,"direction":36},"list-item","Add together the 2 shortest sides and multiply it by 2. Add the length. If the total is less than 245cm, you’re all set.",[],{"type":439,"text":443,"spans":444,"direction":36},"If you’re using a ParcelShop or our Courier service, the maximum length is 120cm",[],{"type":439,"text":446,"spans":447,"direction":36},"If you’re using a Locker, the limit is 62cm x 57cm x 39cm",[],{"type":439,"text":449,"spans":450,"direction":36},"The weight limit for a parcel is 15kg.",[],{"type":33,"text":452,"spans":453,"direction":36},"Visit our dedicated page to find out more about our size and weight limits.",[454,457],{"start":455,"end":115,"type":82,"data":456},28,{"link_type":39,"url":118,"target":85},{"start":455,"end":115,"type":87},{"title":459},"Frequently Asked Questions","frequently_asked_questions$d1820cb8-76d7-475f-a6cb-0fd4b377ee3f","frequently_asked_questions",[24,61,96,133,196,226,246,329,406],["Reactive",464],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":465,"$sclients":531,"$sglobal-basket-count":43},{"abtasty":466,"accessibe":469,"appPromoBanner":472,"autoDivertUpdates":475,"awin":478,"bulkInternational":481,"bulkSendEnabled":484,"businessAccountForm75Enabled":487,"enableBasketCount":490,"enableBulkPhaseTwo":493,"euCustomsDuty":496,"groovyAdvert":499,"newInternationalSendFlow":502,"newinternationalpages":509,"oohPreferenceFlag":513,"opentel":516,"premium":519,"savedCards":522,"smallParcelSize":525,"yourPricesDrawer":528},{"_createdAt":467,"_updatedAt":468,"enabled":322},"2025-11-05T15:39:37.217Z","2025-11-05T15:39:37.452Z",{"_createdAt":470,"_updatedAt":471,"enabled":322},"2025-07-15T08:41:16.873Z","2025-10-28T11:52:03.675Z",{"_createdAt":473,"_updatedAt":474,"enabled":21},"2026-03-06T12:16:35.816Z","2026-03-06T12:16:36.662Z",{"_createdAt":47